{"id":"Wd21d502544a4e2c8ef170ca6","zh":"落锤冲击实验","en":"","name":"落锤冲击实验","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wd21d502544a4e2c8ef170ca6","text":"落锤冲击实验","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7ea796edd1cc3b259fe3","source_id":"P119","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"图1 实验基本内容本实验的主要目的是使学生通过综合性虚拟仿真实验训练,全面掌握:1振动测试仪器的操作使用, 测试参数设置,振动传感器安装方法和测试原理;2 落锤冲击实验原理;3钢弹簧浮置板振动分析和动力特性测定方法;4车辆、车速、轨道不平顺等条件下的轮轨力特征及其对轨道振动的影响;5工程实践中浮置板轨道振动建模、振动测试、振动分析、振动控制的具体方法;6城市轨道交通环境振动评价方法; 7浮置板轨道动力学参数对减振效果及环境振动水平的影响,优化浮置板轨道设计;8强化理论知识综合运用能力及工程技术人员的社会责任感。","citations":[{"source_id":"P119","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P119":{"id":"P119","title":"钢弹簧浮置板减振轨道虚拟仿真实验开发与实践","authors":"朱志辉,刘丽丽,徐磊,曾志平,黄宇佳,钱宇平","year":"2021","doi":"10.16791/j.cnki.sjg.2021.12.022","journal_citation":"实验技术与管理","label":"朱志辉等（2021）","overview_slug":"2021-development-and-practice-of-virtual-simulation-experiment-of-steel-spring-floating-slab-vibration-re"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"实验教学要求掌握的冲击激励实验及其原理。","language":"zh","source_id":"P119","paper_slug":"2021-development-and-practice-of-virtual-simulation-experiment-of-steel-spring-floating-slab-vibration-re","title":"钢弹簧浮置板减振轨道虚拟仿真实验开发与实践","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"We91db66df8d43d88d4c3e0dd","name":"Drop-hammer impact test","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"We91db66df8d43d88d4c3e0dd","name":"Drop-hammer impact test","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"We91db66df8d43d88d4c3e0dd","name":"Drop-hammer impact test","language":"en","kind":"tr